9. : SoftAP EHT capability reset on wlan0
============================================================

ISSUE

EHT was enabled using `wl eht features 3`, but after SoftAP initialization on wlan0 the capability returned to 0x02, effectively showing HE-only capability.

TERMS

EHT: Extremely High Throughput.

hostapd: Host Access Point Daemon.

nl80211: Linux 802.11 netlink interface used for communication between hostapd and the WLAN driver.

WORKAROUND / DEBUG STORY

1. Enabled EHT using `wl eht features 3`.
2. Created the SoftAP on wlan0.
3. Checked the EHT capability again.
4. Compared wlan0 behavior with wlan1.
5. Collected hostapd nl80211 debug output.
6. Observed that HE was enabled but the EHT field was missing after the interface transition.
7. Narrowed the issue towards the primary-interface mode-switch/capability reset path.

STATUS

The captured RCA is that the wlan0 mode-switch path using `NL80211_CMD_SET_INTERFACE` caused a driver capability reset during the primary interface transition. wlan1 did not follow the same reset path.


